+    PROTAC: legacy spherical shell around E3 pocket (±10Å), OR native DiffDock
+    ``randomize_position`` init (uniform torsions + receptor-COM + Gaussian
+    N(0, tr_sigma_max^2)) when ``initialize_protac(..., tr_sigma_max=...)``.
